# Current original GUI and production verification are separate immutable transactions.


# 2026-10-14 Actual nonprivileged source cases and native runtime closure

Actual source-confirmed context cases can be deviceless without altering assertions or disabling root/uinput checks. Shared-memory allocation and Python/GTK runtime graph are separate prerequisites; deploy actual signed SDK and matching Python runtime in own task root, with real version/sys.prefix/maps and ABI-compatible ELF loader paths. Retain GNU linker scripts only for link search, not runtime search. Same-run original282 and separate formalC4/H1 preserve the original1124 denominator and842 unexecuted device definitions.
